agent-tower adapts code from Herdr's shipped mods (defaults/mods/agents, spaces and menu in
herdrdev/herdr-app): the row, group-label and tree-line layout, the status marks, the space
avatar colours, the fold chip, the program icon helper, the popup menu, the narrow-sidebar
(rail) test, the repeated-title note pass, and the machine line with its Copy and Connect
(reconnect) controls.
